ConvexAnalysis — convex analysis and subdifferential calculus for Lean 4 / Mathlib

This package contains files ported from OptLib (https://github.com/optsuite/optlib),
Copyright the OptLib authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(see LICENSE). Ported from commit 5da27c5f95aa6a8a45b8c14b968ade4c13ff18c3
(2026-08-05), which targets Lean/Mathlib v4.13.0.

Modifications: the files under ConvexAnalysis/ were moved from the Optlib namespace
of modules to ConvexAnalysis, and their proofs were updated to compile with
Lean/Mathlib v4.33.1. Theorem names and statements are kept unless noted in
PORTING.md. The algorithm files of OptLib (ADMM, BCD, LASSO, Nesterov, gradient,
subgradient and proximal-gradient methods) are included under ConvexAnalysis/Algorithm.

The files under ConvexAnalysis/Extended/ are ported from the Reaslib part of the
Optlib-v4.24 branch of the same repository (Reaslib/Basic/{EReal,ProperFunction}.lean and
Reaslib/ConvexAnalysis/{Epigraph,ConvexIndicator,IntrinsicInterior,ClosedFunction_Closure,
AffineMinorant,ConvexConjugate,ConvexSupport}.lean), Copyright the OptLib/Reaslib authors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Ported from commit
1ab89cf2c1c46bee690b7a13f0fdf697a491ba38 (2026-02-08), which targets Lean/Mathlib v4.24.0.
Modifications: module names moved from Reaslib to ConvexAnalysis.Extended, proofs updated
for Lean/Mathlib v4.33.1, proofs supplied for four upstream `sorry`s (including the new file
ConvexAnalysis/Extended/AffineMinorantExistence.lean), and the two declarations still without
a proof commented out; see PORTING.md.
